  <key>PayloadDescription</key><string>Adds four Home Screen launchers (Curious, Caring, Constructive, Chill) that each run the matching "Go ..." shortcut. Requires the four shortcuts and Focus modes to already exist — see the setup guide. This profile does not create Focus modes.</string>
